ar.03","text":"Я могу сказать «да», потому что хочу, а не только потому, что этого ждут.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-boundary-radar.04","text":"Я могу попросить больше времени перед решением.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-boundary-radar.05","text":"Я различаю, когда мне нужно больше близости, а когда — пространства.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-boundary-radar.06","text":"Я могу высказать предпочтение, даже если другой человек не согласится.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-boundary-radar.07","text":"Я могу уважать чужое «нет», не воспринимая его как отвержение.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-boundary-radar.08","text":"После обозначения границы я могу возвращаться к контакту.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"}],"optionalContext":[],"suggestedRepeatDays":14,"contentHash":"sha256:0f64fc79d8150100504f335a31f369e0dcceb963574534f8cd1276592fce0743"},{"id":"35700e02-9295-5f9e-87dc-c19ea76e337b","key":"hh-tiny-joys","version":"v1","instrumentLocale":"en","translationVersion":"hh-en-v1","timeframe":"past-7-days","scoringKey":"configured","scoringVersion":"v1","resultVersion":"v1","title":"Tiny Joys Scanner","source":{"title":"Holistic House — Tiny Joys Scanner","status":"original-playful-non-diagnostic-reflection","reviewedAt":"2026-10-06"},"answerScale":{"min":0,"max":4},"responseAnchors":["Not at all","A little","Somewhat","Quite a lot","Very much"],"scoring":{"dimensions":[{"key":"resources.tiny_joys.overall","method":"mean","items":["hh-tiny-joys.01","hh-tiny-joys.02","hh-tiny-joys.03","hh-tiny-joys.04","hh-tiny-joys.05","hh-tiny-joys.06"],"min":0,"max":4,"dimensionClass":"resources","sourceConstruct":"Everyday positive resource","direction":"higher-reported-resource"}]},"questions":[{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.01","text":"I noticed at least one small thing that felt pleasant.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.02","text":"I could enjoy something without needing it to be productive.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.03","text":"There were moments when my body softened or relaxed.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.04","text":"I felt curiosity about something, even briefly.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.05","text":"I had a moment of warmth, humour or connection with another person.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.06","text":"I can name something I would genuinely like more of next week.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"}],"optionalContext":[],"suggestedRepeatDays":14,"contentHash":"sha256:d9193d167aabe53668955537341e28010824ca34a6fb7e23e58dcb40d321ccf9"},{"id":"5be3dc94-a3b1-54a3-9e92-95a48db72d16","key":"hh-tiny-joys","version":"v1","instrumentLocale":"ru","translationVersion":"hh-ru-v1","timeframe":"past-7-days","scoringKey":"configured","scoringVersion":"v1","resultVersion":"v1","title":"Сканер маленьких радостей","source":{"title":"Holistic House — Tiny Joys Scanner","status":"original-playful-non-diagnostic-reflection","reviewedAt":"2026-10-06"},"answerScale":{"min":0,"max":4},"responseAnchors":["Совсем нет","Немного","Отчасти","В значительной степени","Очень сильно"],"scoring":{"dimensions":[{"key":"resources.tiny_joys.overall","method":"mean","items":["hh-tiny-joys.01","hh-tiny-joys.02","hh-tiny-joys.03","hh-tiny-joys.04","hh-tiny-joys.05","hh-tiny-joys.06"],"min":0,"max":4,"dimensionClass":"resources","sourceConstruct":"Повседневный позитивный ресурс","direction":"higher-reported-resource"}]},"questions":[{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.01","text":"Я замечал хотя бы одну маленькую приятную вещь.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.02","text":"Я мог получать удовольствие от чего-то без необходимости быть продуктивным.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.03","text":"Были моменты, когда тело смягчалось или расслаблялось.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.04","text":"Я чувствовал любопытство к чему-то, пусть даже ненадолго.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.05","text":"У меня был момент тепла, юмора или связи с другим человеком.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tiny-joys.06","text":"Я могу назвать то, чего мне искренне хотелось бы больше на следующей неделе.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"}],"optionalContext":[],"suggestedRepeatDays":14,"contentHash":"sha256:9261cd492fdf0f46864ec9256a45162ef76ea4b15d16793b9c5c7590b5f90aae"}]$defs$::jsonb)
  loop
    if exists(
      select 1 from app.assessment_versions
      where id=(d->>'id')::uuid and content_hash<>d->>'contentHash'
    ) then
      raise exception 'Published expanded assessment definition % differs from reviewed definition', d->>'id';
    end if;

    insert into app.assessment_versions(
      id,definition_key,definition_version,instrument_locale,translation_version,
      definition,questions,answer_schema,scoring_key,scoring_version,result_schema,
      timeframe,source_metadata,content_hash
    ) values (
      (d->>'id')::uuid,
      d->>'key',d->>'version',d->>'instrumentLocale',d->>'translationVersion',
      d,d->'questions',
      jsonb_build_object('type','integer','minimum',(d->'answerScale'->>'min')::int,'maximum',(d->'answerScale'->>'max')::int),
      d->>'scoringKey',d->>'scoringVersion',jsonb_build_object('version',d->>'resultVersion'),
      d->>'timeframe',d->'source',d->>'contentHash'
    ) on conflict(id) do nothing;
  end loop;
end $$;

